<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets warrants on CITIC Pacific.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on CITIC Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A., Hong Kong Branch, said on Monday it will issue 100 million American call warrants on CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$37.62	   PREMIUM	 12.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6969	  GEARING	 5.68X</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE	  03.FEB.97	  EXPIRY DATE   03.DEC.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	  LISTING DATE  05.MAR.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG	  MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
